\section*{Claim}
For $SU(3)$ lattice Yang-Mills theory, the normalized single-trace Schwinger-Dyson equation contains irreducible double-trace expectation values and is
\[
\begin{aligned}
0={}&\sum_{\pm\nu\ne\mu}\left[\left\langle w(\mu\nu\bar\mu\bar\nu C)\right\rangle-\left\langle w(\nu\mu\bar\nu\bar\mu C)\right\rangle\right]
-\frac{2\lambda}{9}(\check n_+-n_-)\left\langle w(C)\right\rangle\\
